# Install docker on Ubantu Server 
=> sudo apt install docker.io -y

# how to check if Docker is active 
=> sudo systemctl status docker 

# how to add the user to the docker group
=> sudo usermod -aG docker uday # this will allow me to run the docker images

# What can Docker Client do 
-> Pull -> Run -> Build

# how to pull an image to docker
-> docker run hello-world

